    <h2 class="heading-component__title t-title-m p-0 mb-3 mb-xl-4">Events</h2>
     <p class="heading-component__description t-font-m p-0 m-0" data-threshold="200" data-ellipsis-type="seemore" data-seemore-text="See More" data-seeless-text="See Less">Host memorable meetings and celebrations at Budapest Marriott Hotel, where 16 versatile meeting and event spaces in Budapest combine natural daylight, inspiring city views, and a prime Danube location in the heart of the city. From conferences and corporate gatherings to weddings, gala dinners, and special occasions, the Budapest Ballroom welcomes up to 650 guests, supported by modern AV technology, high-speed internet, tailored catering, and Marriott&#39;s attentive service. Business travelers can make use of the coworking space, while eligible guests enjoy exclusive access to the M Club Lounge with breakfast at DNB Restaurant and evening refreshments. Li Yu certified, the hotel offers dedicated services for Chinese travellers, making it an ideal choice for international meetings, events, and group stays.</p>
